




Install cronie package on all Nautilus app servers and start crond service.
sudo yum search cron
sudo yum list --installed | grep cron

# 1. Install the cronie package
sudo yum install -y cronie                  # -y to skip yes confirmation

# 2. Start the crond daemon service
sudo systemctl start crond.service

# 3. Enable the service to start automatically during system boot
sudo systemctl enable crond.service

# 4. Verify that the service is running actively
sudo systemctl status crond.service
